<html>
<title>How can I emulate the A/D Input?</title>
<body>

<h1>How can I emulate the A/D Input?</h1>

<p>
The emulator simulates two A/D Input functions:
</p>

<pre>
A/DI    Converting input voltage -99 to 999 mV
A/DS    Converting input voltage 0 to 1500 mV
</pre>

<p>
Both functions are only available when expansion ROM 151182 is loaded and can be used for channels 0 to E (hexadecimal), or to F when using the <tt>A/DS</tt> function.
</p>

<p>
For an example of using <tt>A/DI</tt>, see the <tt>demo2.txt</tt> program in the TMC-600 directory (Temperature part).
</p>

</body>
</html>

